Z||000000||BravelilFiero||12-16-2001||08:00 PM||||I read back in about August's post of this year, that someone was going to make a digital gauge console, do you know if it was done????    and reading about, adding a 3rd brake light, is there a spoiler out there that would fit a fiero, that already has the brake light in it, just needs the wires to connect??||||reg||10
