Z||000003||REDHOTT88||12-16-2001||09:51 PM||||Chester and Elvira.. who post here,<BR>have the digital dash installed in one of their Fiero's. <P>I've seen it in person, they live about 20 minutes from me, it's actually pretty cool and Chester said it was easy to hook up!<P>Look up a previous thread called: "Show me your guages" or something like that from about 2 days ago. He has big pictures posted near the end of the thread!<P>------------------<BR>                                                                                                         <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/FIREdevil.gif">       <FONT COLOR="ffoooo"> <B>1988 Formula 2.8L</B> V6 5 speed </FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1">(Runs smooth, shifts crisp, red and shiny all over!)</FONT>||||reg||1
